{"reviewId": "13294121_8bg52E3oo", "review": {"abstract": "黄金的实际持有收益率在康波的衰退和萧条期趋于上行，在萧条期达到高点，而在复苏和繁荣期趋于下降。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "如果认可2026-2030是萧条向回升转换的时期，那么按照周金涛的理论，黄金将迎来20年之久的长熊。加上2022-2026年黄金的史诗级疯牛，积累的风险已经太大。虽然各国央行都在加大购金力度，但这更多是地缘政治考虑。未来十年，我不认为黄金是值得配置的投资资产。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "892-939", "createTime": 1786372029, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "13294121_8bg52E3oo", "userVid": 13294121, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 13294121, "name": "夏然", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEIeMI778aXNaPMkgDBdmvWRXYyu1E4FN1IwQuK4rVkNMcUNbQR2vUiah5cF6APuvUo1xGiaP5HLGcOg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-200", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 200}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 6, "likes": [{"userVid": 271117535, "name": "梦里看花，醉里挑灯", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTK7zuvOZ4OGNLLrNh40cK0ic9h3SHrxqtZOm3ofibczKEiaqrUQnhibKJmZZ9uvhAJI5C15vsVxOicrTng/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240219-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "le